meta {
  name: add-facility
  seq: 13
}

docs {
  "Add a facility" (ADR-016): search the Health Facility Registry before a Care facility exists, read
  the Care prefill for 1 record, and create the Care facility through Care's own create path with the
  record linked in the same call. Entered from the ABDM admin dashboard or an organization's facilities
  page. The routes need Care's `can_create_facility`. `organizationId` is optional context: the default
  `geo_organization` when the form sends none.
}
